# Witness: an exclusion citation written in markdown italics

An underscore is a word character, so a pattern anchored with a word boundary does not merely
mis-parse an italicised citation - it never sees it at all, and an undefined exclusion goes
entirely unreported. Section 11 of HUMAN_REVIEW.md writes its placeholders the same way, so
this is a spelling the authors already use.

Three limits are carried by the VM-1 bundle rather than restated here: _EX-95_ for the
unmeasured start-up path, and two others.

## 9. Exclusions

| ID | Status | Exclusion |
|---|---|---|
| EX-01 | Open | The inbound half of the legacy-boundary rule is environment-conditional. |
